{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "小津ジャーン！"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202609/mobPNsRuL.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんにちは！こんばんは！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "小津玲奈です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "B.L.T.さんの10月号に"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "掲載していただいています！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "夏らしくプールで撮影したり"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "夏の終わりを感じるような"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "河川敷を歩いたり"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "涼しくなりつつもまだ夏の香りが残る雰囲気を"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "素敵に撮っていただいているので"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最近涼しくなってきて"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まだ夏に未練のあるよーという方は"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ぜひお手に取ってみてください！"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202609/mobGyxQRb.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "さてさて"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まだまだ夏が恋しいと言いながら"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "もうすでに9月中旬"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そう！秋なのです🍂"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "秋といえば、、、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "読書の秋？スポーツの秋？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私はもちろん"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "食欲の秋！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "焼き芋に栗ご飯、サンマにきのこ、、、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "大変！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "書いている間に"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お腹がすいてきちゃった！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "実は私、365日"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "毎日さつまいもを食べるほどの"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "芋好きなのです🍠"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "美味しいお芋が街に溢れかえる"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この季節は最高です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "街中で芋スイーツや芋料理を"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "見かけるた